# LF in the repository and in the working tree: every file in this project is UTF-8 without a BOM, LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Except Windows batch files, which must be CRLF: cmd.exe misreads labels and some lines of a batch
# file that has LF-only line endings.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# And shell scripts stay LF on every checkout, whatever git's settings: sh cannot run a CRLF script.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.command text eol=lf
